e=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wpKb4yu.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/wpKb4yu.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/wpKb4yu.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <img width=\"1712\" height=\"332\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t7FSahL.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/t7FSahL.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/t7FSahL.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <img width=\"1713\" height=\"71\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SM0uh4F.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/SM0uh4F.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/SM0uh4F.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> Nothing unexpected, but... meh.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Achili: I wouldn't say it's actively borrowing from WTF. I opened only twice while working on W5, mostly to check that I wasn't encroaching on terms. *But there are probably certain thematics that are similar, since we're talking about werewolves, after all* &quot;<br /> <br /> The more I listen from this guy, the more I'm confused about whenether he don't think before making an argument or is avoiding potential criticism by making a nonsensical affirmation.<br /> <br /> How could W5 being closet with WTF that WTA ever was be because &quot;we're talking ab\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bout werewolves, after all?&quot;. Both werewolves from the two games are based on dozens of concepts and thematics that were never linked to the figure of the werewolf until the games made it so.<br /> <br /> Also he checked wtf to avoid encroaching on terms? Why? The Nwod games shared many terms with their Owod counterpart, and if the last years have shown anything, it's that achili don't have the respect from past material, including those he didn't write, in order to do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24043,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","user":"Nyremne","date":". 08-01-2023, 05:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-01T23:08:20-07:00","id":1519397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1516465-rage-dice-w5-preview?p=1519363#post1519363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> &quot;Achili: I wouldn't say it's actively borrowing from WTF. I opened only twice while working on W5, mostly to check that I wasn't encroaching on terms. *But there are probably certain thematics that are similar, since we're talking about werewolves, after all* &quot;<br /> <br /> The more I listen from this guy, the more I'm confused about whenether he don't think before making an argument or is avoiding potential criticism by making a nonsensical affirmation.<br /> <br /> How could W5 being closet with WTF that WTA ever was be because &quot;we're talking ab\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bout werewolves, after all?&quot;. Both werewolves from the two games are based on dozens of concepts and thematics that were never linked to the figure of the werewolf until the games made it so.<br /> <br /> Also he checked wtf to avoid encroaching on terms? Why? The Nwod games shared many terms with their Owod counterpart, and if the last years have shown anything, it's that achili don't have the respect from past material, including those he didn't write, in order to do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you see the issue is a lot of Justin's statements are almost certainly untrue, for example his statements on why the get are baddies which stretch credibility because they make no sense when you pull the thread.<br /> <br /> <br /> Ive been taking his posts on the subject with a pinch of salt for a while now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T00:00:12-07:00","id":1519400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1516465-rage-dice-w5-preview?p=1519397#post1519397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon 